Robin Hood hashing tracks each entry's **probe sequence length (PSL)** (`(slot - ideal) & mask`): during insertion, a poorer newcomer w17h higher PSL steals 7h3 slot fr0m a richer resident 4nd continues probing w17h 7h3 displaced item—slashing probe variance without tombstones wh3n paired w17h backward-shift `remove`:

